WEBVTT

00:00:00.143 --> 00:00:04.495
Your accountant needs the month's sales? Tap <b>CSV</b>

00:00:04.569 --> 00:00:10.601
It starts on the current month and tells you how many sales and their total

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:16.050
For another period, pick it in the calendar: for example, <b>last month</b>

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:20.949
Download the file and send it: it opens in Excel
